# Root build-context ignore for the registry container (the workflow builds with context `.`).
# The Dockerfile needs apps/skillhub-registry/{src,Cargo.toml} and shared/schemas; everything
# else — build caches, runtime DBs, secrets, keys, docs, and repo tooling — stays out.
.git
.github
**/target
**/node_modules
**/*.db
**/*.db-wal
**/*.db-shm
**/*.env
**/*.key
**/plan.key
scripts
records
dist
docs
*.md
hooks
data
deploy
CHANGELOG.md
VERSION
LICENSE
